' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  2-3 ADM phases each with their artifacts and phase-to-phase inputs/outputs.
'   usecase:      Teach artifacts per phase and input/output handoffs between phases.
'   complexity:   medium
'   domain:       enterprise / architecture-method
' ============================================================================
title Example TOGAF ADM - Medium Phase Artifacts

note as TopNote
  Phases B, C, D each show their key artifacts.
  Arrows = phase handoffs (output of one feeds input of next).
end note

' ---- Phase B: Business Architecture ----
package "Phase B: Business Architecture" as PB {
  rectangle "Artifact: Business Footprint" as BF
  rectangle "Artifact: Organization Map" as OM
  rectangle "Artifact: Business Process\nCatalog & Matrix" as BPC
}

' ---- Phase C: Information Systems Architectures (Data + App) ----
package "Phase C: Information Systems" as PC {
  rectangle "Artifact: Data Entity Catalog" as DEC
  rectangle "Artifact: Application Portfolio" as AP
  rectangle "Artifact: Data Dissemination\nDiagram" as DDD
}

' ---- Phase D: Technology Architecture ----
package "Phase D: Technology Architecture" as PD {
  rectangle "Artifact: Technology Standards\nCatalog" as TSC
  rectangle "Artifact: Platform Decomposition" as PLD
}

' Phase-to-phase handoffs (output -> input)
BPC --> DEC : output: process-to-data
OM --> AP : output: org-to-app
DEC --> DDD : output: data model
DDD --> TSC : output: data hosting needs
AP --> PLD : output: app platform needs

' Within-phase sequencing
BF --> OM
OM --> BPC
DEC --> AP
TSC --> PLD
